# Only needed for the optional private API coverage package (@zaytsman/playwright-api-coverage).
# Without it, npm install skips the package and the tests run without the coverage report.
#
# With access to the package, put this line in your USER npmrc (~/.npmrc,
# on Windows %USERPROFILE%\.npmrc), never in the repo's .npmrc.
# The token is a GitHub classic token with the read:packages scope.

//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=<your token>
